{"slug":"mid-eastern-conflict-sim-790UI-MECS-133961","_id":"69ae5ac3ec95ce09d152c187","title":"790UI MECS","game":{"_id":"69a700765697714286b8b323","gameId":9531918774,"name":"mid eastern conflict sim","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":9531918774},"features":"Premium ACS Multi-Tool | Silent Aim & ESP (Clean UI) [Keyless]\nDescription:\nTired of bulky, laggy, and easily detected scripts? This is a highly optimized, beautifully designed Silent Aim and ESP script specifically tailored for any game running on the ACS (Advanced Combat System) framework. It seamlessly bypasses basic server-side distance checks by modifying the exact raycast data ACS expects, ensuring your shots register perfectly every time.\n\nWrapped in a gorgeous, custom-built macOS dark-mode interface, this script gives you complete control without cluttering your screen or dropping your frames.\n\nKey Features:\n\nFlawless Silent Aim: Intercepts ACS remotes perfectly. Bullets curve to the target while your camera stays completely free.\n\nSmart Wall Check: Built-in raycasting ensures you only lock onto targets you can actually see, keeping your gameplay looking natural and preventing \"shooting through walls\" callouts.\n\nLegit Bone Targeting: Fully adjustable Headshot and Hit Chance sliders. If the headshot misses its RNG roll, it randomly targets other limbs to avoid suspicious 100% headshot logs.\n\nDynamic Visibility ESP: High-performance drawing-based ESP. Boxes auto-scale with distance and change color in real-time (Yellow = Visible / Red = Behind Wall).\n\nSleek macOS UI: A completely custom, draggable dark-mode UI with smooth toggles, sliders, and the classic Mac traffic light window buttons.\n\nZero Lag: Built using RenderStepped and localized variables for maximum execution speed and zero frame drops.\n\nControls & Usage:\n\nRight Shift: Hide or show the UI seamlessly.\n\nSimply execute the script, drag the window where you want it, and use the sliders to dial in your perfect settings.","tags":["MECS","Silent Aim","ESP","Keyless"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastes.io/raw/UaC2RfZ4\"))()","owner":{"_id":"699624824bfacc34694f061c","username":"abdudepostio","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"699624824bfacc34694f061c","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"verified":false,"views":6012,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/2d80a1a4a9fff64b9e0b9a78c4c4fbb9082ea64727efeda8c2026e0d2a69c2a2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-2bcfb28b5d1771f44ae9b981c80f8ac0-011155eacda8.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-2bcfb28b5d1771f44ae9b981c80f8ac0-011155eacda8.png"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-03-09T05:29:39.843Z","executes":649,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-16T02:22:15.505Z","last":"","win":14,"math":2},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/2d80a1a4a9fff64b9e0b9a78c4c4fbb9082ea64727efeda8c2026e0d2a69c2a2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-2bcfb28b5d1771f44ae9b981c80f8ac0-011155eacda8.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-2bcfb28b5d1771f44ae9b981c80f8ac0-011155eacda8.png"},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69ae5ac3ec95ce09d152c18a","editBy":{"_id":"699624824bfacc34694f061c","username":"abdudepostio","status":"offline","id":"699624824bfacc34694f061c"},"message":"UI Public v1.0.0","createdAt":"2026-03-09T05:29:39.845Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69ae5ad9